Reference K/V storage adapted from the per-token/per-head 32-channel INT8 prefix-cache approach in WanGP
https://github.com/deepbeepmeep/WanGP/blob/9905f0df941e5ec7b0c80e32555d3a61fe415726/shared/attention_kit.py
The portable implementation retains FP32 scales, existing attention backends, and bounded dequantization scratch.
